MODULE: BankingMonotoneReturnDiscardsPrefix
TARGET: BankingMonotone
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the permit-return boundary forgets an already banked prefix

--- FIND
    /\ role' = [role EXCEPT ![r] = "Interactive"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<queue, observed, pressure, pressurePhase, drain,
        frontier, banked, checkpoint, holes, ledger, arrivalsClosed, dispatchEpoch>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ banked' = [p \in Partitions |-> 0]
    /\ role' = [role EXCEPT ![r] = "Interactive"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<queue, observed, pressure, pressurePhase, drain,
        frontier, checkpoint, holes, ledger, arrivalsClosed, dispatchEpoch>>
--- END
